## Persistence layers

- PostgreSQL: application/business data and Olist data.
- SQLite: LangGraph checkpoints.
- Qdrant: vector store for RAG documents.
- MLflow: traces, experiments and evaluation.

There is currently no CSV-to-SQLite application-data migration in the repository. Olist CSVs are loaded into PostgreSQL by `backend/app/scripts/load_olist_data.py`.
